<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The company Hero Honda first came to india in 1980s. The Indi an automobile market was still developing , dominated by local players like Bajaj, the cus tomer prioritize affordability , efficiency , fuel and durability over luxury. when they joined hands with the Hero group. This collaboration led to the start of a revolution in the field of 2 wheeler vehicles in india.It also made the compa ny worlds largest motorcycle manufacturer. Despite being a foreign player, the company was quite able to understand the motive an taste of the local people what they needed and delivered to them. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
492 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By the late 90s , they were able to set up HMSI as a wholly owned subsidiary. Helping them to produce cars and scooty of the local people with very high efficiency. The also invested in local manufacturing plants, reducing the cost of imports and signed a long term deal in india. After the split with Hero, Honda launched its Honda is Honda campaign , a strategy to re-estab lish the brands market value and regain customers trust. Even hiring Akshay Kumar as their brand ambassador was a good strategy for honda as they were able to establish their boots once again in the automo bile industry . At that time, Honda sold over 1 million units annually across India subse quently increasing the dealership of Honda.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
